CONTEXT OnlyPopulated
-- B has a population of its own, and no relation or term names it.
-- Without a table for B, nothing records that "b1" is a B.
CLASSIFY B ISA A
CLASSIFY C ISA A
REPRESENT A TYPE MULTITABLE
RELATION naam[A*Text] [UNI]
RELATION rc[C*Text] [UNI]
POPULATION B CONTAINS [ "b1" ]
POPULATION naam CONTAINS [ ("a1","A een"), ("b1","B een") ]
ENDCONTEXT
